#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:personal_trainer.welcome_article_body
msgid "Odoo offers you infinite possibilities, such as:"
msgstr "Odoo vam ponuja neskončne možnosti, kot so:"

#. module: personal_trainer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:personal_trainer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Organize group classes, workshops, and fitness events easily with the "
"<strong>Events</strong> app."
msgstr ""
"Z aplikacijo <strong>Dogodki</strong> preprosto organizirajte skupinske "
"vadbe, delavnice in fitnes dogodke."

#. module: personal_trainer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:personal_trainer.welcome_article_body
msgid "Project Tracking 📈"
msgstr "Sledenje projektom 📈"

#. module: personal_trainer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:personal_trainer.welcome_article_body
msgid "Reach us"
msgstr "Kontaktirajte nas"

#. module: personal_trainer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:personal_trainer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Regularly update your CRM to keep track of potential clients and follow-ups."
msgstr ""
"Redno posodabljajte svoj CRM, da boste lahko spremljali potencialne stranke "
"in nadaljnje stike."

#. module: personal_trainer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:personal_trainer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Remember, Odoo is flexible and can adapt to your specific needs. Don't "
"hesitate to explore and customize as your coaching business grows!"
msgstr ""
"Ne pozabite, Odoo je prilagodljiv in se lahko prilagodi specifičnim potrebam "
"vašega trenerskega podjetja. Ne oklevajte z raziskovanjem in prilagajanjem, "
"ko vaše podjetje raste!"

#. module: personal_trainer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:personal_trainer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Set up appointment types (e.g., \"60-min Personal Training\", \"30-min "
"Assessment\")"
msgstr ""
"Nastavite vrste terminov (npr. \"60-minutni osebni trening\", \"30-minutna "
"ocena\")"

#. module: personal_trainer
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:personal_trainer.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Set up services like \"10-Session Personal Training Package\" or \"3-Month "
"Transformation Program\""
msgstr ""
"Nastavite storitve, kot sta \"Paket osebnega trenerstva z 10 vadbami\" ali "
"\"3-mesečni program preobrazbe\""

#. module: personal_trainer
#: model:product.template,name:personal_trainer.product_product_8_product_template
msgid "Single Training Session"
msgstr "Posamezna vadbena seja"

